      "writtenOn": "2023-12-14T18:35:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The synchronous part means -- make sure the D-bus is shut down before you send the shutdown message to IBluetooth (to avoid races).\n\nIf you want to re-use the message passing, you may want to use a oneshot channel to enforce a wait-for-response mechanism.",
